<title>USA: Yonkers Financial Q2 net income $748,000.</title>
<headline>Yonkers Financial Q2 net income $748,000.</headline>
<dateline>YONKERS, N.Y. 1997-04-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997		    1996</p>
<p> Net shr	   $0.26		    $n/a</p>
<p> Net		 748			400</p>
<p> Avg shrs	  2,914		    n/a</p>
<p>	   6 MONTHS  Ended March 31</p>
<p> Net shr	   $0.48		    $n/a</p>
<p> Net		 1,415		    791</p>
<p> Avg shrs	  n/a			n/a</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>Note: The company said per share earings data for the three and six month periods in 1996 are not applicable since it went public on April 18, 1996.</p>
<p>The company reported total assets for the quarter of $284.4 million compared with $259.5 million.</p>
<p>Provisions for loan losses were $75,000 versus $50,000.</p>
<p>The company's full name is Yonkers Financial Corp.</p>
